Z||000000||86SE||08-18-2000||03:43 AM||||Well, this badboy was painted WAY WAY back at the end of July, I just got the film developed.<P>Here it is all tore up, a total of 2 body panels stayed on, 3 shown in picture.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://fierodude.hypermart.net/torn3.jpg">   <P>All painted up and re-assembled, took 2 days to re-assemble.  gas cap had a run in it.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://fierodude.hypermart.net/YellowLeft.jpg">  <P>Mean lookin front end.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://fierodude.hypermart.net/YellowFront.jpg">  <P><BR>I have PLENTY more, i'll make some sort of slid show that shows most of the process.<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Stering wheel<BR>Gas AND brake petals<BR>**Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention**<p>[This message has been edited by 86SE (edited 08-18-2000).]||||reg||14
