Z||000010||86SE||08-18-2000||01:33 PM||||It will be plenty fast when I drop in a 3.4!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>As for the bumpers, I think Pontiac offered an 'aero' package for the 86SE's.  If not, they all came with the aero package, because I have never seen one without the cool bumpers and ground effcts.<P>GT Bastard, tuesday-wendsday works for me!  Just might have to take it over there some day!<P><BR>These are all pictures taken when it was fairly dark and in the building.  It looks even better out in the sun with the light reflecting off it.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://fierodude.hypermart.net/YellowRight.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Yellow Fiero<BR>Special Rally Heavy Duty Suspention||||reg||10
